MyRunner Map Legend

0 - Empty space (sky)
1 - Solid ground (green blocks)
2 - Spikes/hazards (red blocks, deadly to player)
3 - Special decorative blocks (blue blocks)

Map format:
- First line can contain metadata or be part of the map
- Each character represents a tile
- Spaces represent empty tiles (type 0)
- Numbers 1-3 represent different tile types
- Player spawns at position (100, ground_level - player_height)
- Map scrolls from right to left automatically